---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { REPO_ROOT } from '../lib/github';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="About | printablelogs"
  description="Project framing and intended product shape for printablelogs."
>
  <section class="container prose-block">
    <p class="eyebrow">/ about</p>
    <h1>About printablelogs</h1>
    <p>
      printablelogs is a print-first tool for making handwriting-friendly
      tracking sheets faster than drawing them by hand.
    </p>
    <p>
      The current MVP focuses on one job: configuring a table log, previewing it
      as a printable page, and exporting a clean one-page PDF for Letter or A4
      in portrait or landscape.
    </p>
    <p>
      The longer-term product vision includes digitization and visualization, but
      those are intentionally out of scope for now. Planned requirements live in
      the root docs, and source lives on
      <a href={REPO_ROOT} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"> GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .prose-block {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    max-width: 46rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
</style>
